    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Event</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A significant occurrence that triggers a change in policy status or benefits. Induced from a Placed as subClassOf owl:Thing (Stage 5, confidence: high); cluster of 1 surface variant(s) merged in Stage 3.</rdfs:comment>
