    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Personal Data Collection</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Indicates a specific data protection requirement imposed by an insurance contract, such as restrictions on personal data collection, confidentiality obligations, limitations on data use, or compliance with data use polic…</rdfs:comment>
