    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Contingent beneficiary receives payout under specific conditions. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property links contingent beneficiaries to eligibility conditions for payout, supported by evidence of surv…</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A beneficiary who receives benefits if the primary beneficiary predeceases the policyholder.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/insurance#Beneficiary"/>
